<Base title="Contact Kitchen Watcher" description="How to reach Kitchen Watcher with corrections, product suggestions or questions about our research." crumbs={[{ name: 'Contact', path: '/contact/' }]}>
  <article>
    <h1>Contact Kitchen Watcher</h1>
    <p class="dek">Corrections, product suggestions and questions about our research are all welcome.</p>

    <p>Our email inbox is being set up and will be listed here shortly.</p>

    <h2>What to write to us about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Corrections.</strong> A wrong number, a broken link, a recall we missed. Tell us the page and what's wrong; we fix errors and note the change.</li>
      <li><strong>Product suggestions.</strong> A model you'd like compared, or a problem you've had with something we cover.</li>
      <li><strong>Brands and retailers.</strong> We're happy to receive product documentation and spec corrections. Nobody can buy coverage or a ranking.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>You can also read <a href="/how-we-research/">how we research</a> and our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
